    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Trigger:</em> The [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster} is [[lookup @activation.condition activity=aLG3BRZL7P6OEjwd]]. <em>Response:</em> The [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster} adds [[lookup @roll.formula activity=aLG3BRZL7P6OEjwd]] to its AC against that attack, possibly causing it to miss.</p><div class=\"cat-description\"><p><em>midi-qol: When a melee attack roll hits, the creature is offered Parry (its reaction) to add the bonus to its AC against that attack. Whether it holds a weapon is left to the GM.</em></p></div>",
